en:
//　苦痛がない。
//　その無感覚こそおぞましい。
  There is no pain, but even the cruelest agony would be preferable to the㉓<I>absence</I>㉓of sensation. I feel only a deep, deep cold, as if the limb were submerged in a pool of liquid darkness.

//　左腕と全く同じく、左脚は指の先まで一切が動かな
//かった。闇に浸したかのような冷たさだけがある。
//　村正の回復力をもってしても、治癒には幾日要する
//か。
  Now my left leg is as much dead weight as my left arm. It will take Muramasa days to fully repair the damage, days that I may well not have. The enemy is whittling away at our strength like a knife peeling an onion, and I only have one limb left.

//　この際は、そんな事を思い煩う日々へ辿り着けるか
//どうかが問われているが。
